.\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)$."] [:db/add "f1092196-2b1e-5ceb-b32f-25be161533c4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f1092196-2b1e-5ceb-b32f-25be161533c4" :question/answer-fields "82957dd3-27e2-5af4-8713-71a0ee257562"] [:db/ensure "f1092196-2b1e-5ceb-b32f-25be161533c4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124630 :knowledge-point/questions "f1092196-2b1e-5ceb-b32f-25be161533c4"] [:db/add "b2583ecf-8bbb-5a3a-9b7b-8101ae883bee" :answer/id #uuid "b2583ecf-8bbb-5a3a-9b7b-8101ae883bee"] [:db/add "b2583ecf-8bbb-5a3a-9b7b-8101ae883bee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b2583ecf-8bbb-5a3a-9b7b-8101ae883bee" :answer/value "n"] [:db/ensure "b2583ecf-8bbb-5a3a-9b7b-8101ae883bee" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9a973bcf-70db-5a89-a689-b55ce1af4a80" :answer/id #uuid "9a973bcf-70db-5a89-a689-b55ce1af4a80"] [:db/add "9a973bcf-70db-5a89-a689-b55ce1af4a80" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9a973bcf-70db-5a89-a689-b55ce1af4a80" :answer/value "\\mathbb{R}^{n}"] [:db/ensure "9a973bcf-70db-5a89-a689-b55ce1af4a80" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fbee72da-3edd-5510-88b6-7c2b8327142e" :answer/id #uuid "fbee72da-3edd-5510-88b6-7c2b8327142e"] [:db/add "fbee72da-3edd-5510-88b6-7c2b8327142e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fbee72da-3edd-5510-88b6-7c2b8327142e" :answer/value "n+1"] [:db/ensure "fbee72da-3edd-5510-88b6-7c2b8327142e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b1783284-0306-56fc-9b19-67e44e5dc329" :answer/id #uuid "b1783284-0306-56fc-9b19-67e44e5dc329"] [:db/add "b1783284-0306-56fc-9b19-67e44e5dc329" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b1783284-0306-56fc-9b19-67e44e5dc329" :answer/value "\\{0\\}"] [:db/ensure "b1783284-0306-56fc-9b19-67e44e5dc329" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5c4b21a8-5857-5ef8-bfd3-a65eb1a523c0" :answer/id #uuid "5c4b21a8-5857-5ef8-bfd3-a65eb1a523c0"] [:db/add "5c4b21a8-5857-5ef8-bfd3-a65eb1a523c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5c4b21a8-5857-5ef8-bfd3-a65eb1a523c0